# dctx Global Ignore Rules
#
# These patterns apply to ALL projects scanned by dctx.
# Files matching these patterns will be EXCLUDED from directory context output.
#
# Syntax: Same as .gitignore
# - One pattern per line
# - Lines starting with # are comments
# - Use ! to negate a pattern (include something that was previously excluded)
# - Supports wildcards (* and **)
#
# Examples:
#   node_modules/     - Ignore node_modules directory everywhere
#   *.log             - Ignore all .log files
#   !important.log    - But include important.log
#   dist/             - Ignore dist directory
#
# Default rules:

node_modules/
